{
  "title": { "zh": "让频谱仪接收自己的输出", "en": "Let the analyser receive complex data" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "逐行频谱仪能把一行变成两张系数表。下一步要把第一次分析的结果沿另一条轴再分析一次。如果只读取实部，第一条轴上某些条纹的位置就丢了。试一张实部为零的输入，看看哪一路读数证明虚部仍在工作。",
        "en": "The row analyser turns a row into two coefficient tables. To extend it to two dimensions, the second axis must analyse the result of the first. Reading just the real table can lose the positions of some stripes. Try an input with zero real part and see which output shows that the imaginary input still contributes."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "\\[\\begin{gathered}(a+ib)(\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta)\\\\=(a\\cos\\theta+b\\sin\\theta)\\\\+i(b\\cos\\theta-a\\sin\\theta)\\end{gathered}\\]\n\na、b 是输入的实部、虚部，θ 是当前参考波角度。两个输入分量都会影响输出的两个分量，不能只把实部送进频谱仪。逐样本使用这个关系并取平均，仍沿用同一套前向归一化。 <wiki-ref to=\"complex-transform\"></wiki-ref>",
    "en": "\\[\\begin{gathered}(a+ib)(\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta)\\\\=(a\\cos\\theta+b\\sin\\theta)\\\\+i(b\\cos\\theta-a\\sin\\theta)\\end{gathered}\\]\n\na and b are input real and imaginary parts; θ is the reference angle. Both input parts affect both output parts, so retaining only the real input loses information. Applying this relationship over samples and averaging keeps the same forward normalisation. <wiki-ref to=\"complex-transform\"></wiki-ref>"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "v2_complex",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "保留复数信息",
        "en": "Retain complex data"
      },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "扩展你的分析仪，使它接受两张输入表。实数输入必须维持原先的结果，只有虚部的输入也要得到完整的两路读数。",
        "en": "Extend your analyser to accept two input tables. Real-only inputs must keep their old results, and imaginary-only inputs must still produce both outputs."
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "real", "label": { "zh": "输入实部", "en": "Input real" } },
        { "name": "imag", "label": { "zh": "输入虚部", "en": "Input imaginary" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "re", "label": { "zh": "输出实部", "en": "Output real" } },
        { "name": "im", "label": { "zh": "输出虚部", "en": "Output imaginary" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": { "real": [[0.25, 1.25, 0.25, -0.75]], "imag": [[0, 0, 0, 0]] },
          "expect": {
            "re": [[0.25, 0, 0, 0]],
            "im": [[0, -0.5, 0, 0.5]]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": { "real": [[0, 0, 0, 0]], "imag": [[0.25, 1.25, 0.25, -0.75]] },
          "expect": {
            "re": [
              [0, 0.5, 0, -0.5]
            ],
            "im": [
              [0.25, 0, 0, 0]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": { "real": [[0.2, 0.8, 0.3, 0.5]], "imag": [[0.1, 0.2, -0.1, 0.4]] },
          "expect": {
            "re": [[0.45, -0.07500000000000001, -0.19999999999999996, 0.02500000000000003]],
            "im": [[0.15000000000000002, -0.025000000000000033, -0.15000000000000005, 0.12500000000000006]]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": { "real": [[0.1, 0.4, 0.7], [0.8, 0.2, 0.5]], "imag": [[0.1, -0.2, 0.3], [0.4, 0, -0.1]] },
          "expect": {
            "re": [
              [0.39999999999999997, -0.2943375672974065, -0.005662432702593395],
              [0.5, 0.17886751345948124, 0.12113248654051882]
            ],
            "im": [
              [0.06666666666666667, 0.1032692070451104, -0.06993587371177726],
              [0.10000000000000002, 0.23660254037844383, 0.06339745962155602]
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [],
      "solution": [
        "a = spectrum(real)",
        "b = spectrum(imag)",
        "r = arithmetic[op=sub](a.re,b.im)",
        "i = arithmetic[op=add](a.im,b.re)",
        "re <- r",
        "im <- i"
      ],
      "naive": ["a = spectrum(real)", "re <- a.re", "im <- a.im"],
      "views": { "grid": ["plot", "numbers", "pixels"] },
      "starter": ["a = spectrum(real)", "re <- a.re", "im <- a.im"],
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "第二条输入也是信号。二维的第二轴不能丢弃第一轴产生的虚部。",
        "en": "The imaginary input also carries signal. A second-axis transform must retain first-axis imaginary data."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "先分别查看只有实部和只有虚部的测试。比较它们对两个输出的影响和符号，再处理两者都存在的情况。",
          "en": "Inspect the real-only and imaginary-only cases separately. Compare which outputs they affect and with which signs before handling both together."
        }
      ],
